'''Macho Man''' (マッチョマン, ''Macchoman'', '''Macho Man''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Strengthen" Effect UP (Sm): Strengthen Up buff increases by 20%.

